<p class="mb-4"><strong>Setup cost:</strong> three minutes. Sign up at <a href="https://openrouter.ai" target="_blank" rel="nofollow">openrouter.ai</a>, generate a key, paste into Cursor's OpenAI-compatible provider settings with base URL <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded text-sm">https://openrouter.ai/api/v1</code>. Cursor 0.41+ supports the OpenRouter model picker directly.</p>

<p class="mb-4"><strong>Watch out:</strong> OpenRouter charges a small markup (typically 5-10%) on top of the underlying provider's list price. For high-volume workloads where you're paying 6+ figures a month, direct vendor contracts are cheaper. For individuals and small teams, the convenience premium is worth it.</p>

